Name: biosig
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Date: @PACKAGE_DATE@
Author: Alois Schloegl <alois.schloegl@ist.ac.at>
Maintainer: Alois Schlögl
Title: The mexBiosig toolbox
Description: The Biosig package provides a number of tools
   for biomedical signal processing, including importing of
   about 50 different data formations.
Depends: octave (> 3.2.0)
Recommends: general, signal, statistics, nan, tsa
SystemRequirements: octave (> 3.2.0), libbiosig1 | libbiosig2 | libbiosig3
BuildRequires: libbiosig-dev (> 1.3.0)
License: GPLv3+
Url: https://biosig.sourceforge.net/
Autoload: yes
Categories: EEG ECG EMG EOG biomedical signals dataformat

